<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Nestjs on K-Life Hack | Systems Architecture &amp; DevOps</title><link>https://klifehack.com/en/tags/nestjs/</link><description>Recent content in Nestjs on K-Life Hack | Systems Architecture &amp; DevOps</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 10:47:44 +0900</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://klifehack.com/en/tags/nestjs/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Nginx Reverse Proxy Design and Port Binding in a Next.js / NestJS Multi-Container Architecture</title><link>https://klifehack.com/en/p/nginx-reverse-proxy-docker-multi-tier/</link><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 10:47:44 +0900</pubDate><guid>https://klifehack.com/en/p/nginx-reverse-proxy-docker-multi-tier/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Co-locating frontend and backend roles on a single application server and individually exposing public ports introduces bottlenecks in scaling out components and maintaining security. Particularly in microservice architectures and decoupled frontend/backend architectures, centralizing endpoints and isolating internal networks are essential. This document outlines the design and verification procedures for a multi-tier container architecture that decouples the frontend (Next.js), backend (NestJS), and database (MySQL), integrating Nginx as a unified entry point for ingress traffic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="network-configuration-and-container-topology"&gt;Network Configuration and Container Topology
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;In this configuration, all external requests are received by the Nginx reverse proxy (Port 80) and routed to the appropriate service on the internal Docker bridge network based on the URI path. Application containers do not bind directly to the host&amp;rsquo;s public network ports; instead, they communicate using service name resolution provided by Docker&amp;rsquo;s internal DNS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;Docker Network (Bridge Interface)
│
├── nginx (Ingress / Routing Layer)
├── frontend (Next.js Application)
├── backend (NestJS API Engine)
└── database (MySQL Instance)
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;h3 id="container-configuration-file-docker-composeyml"&gt;Container Configuration File (docker-compose.yml)
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;In the service definitions, the &lt;code&gt;ports&lt;/code&gt; section is restricted exclusively to Nginx, allowing other containers to communicate only within &lt;code&gt;app-network&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-yaml" data-lang="yaml"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;version&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;3.8&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;networks&lt;/span&gt;:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;app-network&lt;/span&gt;:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;driver&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;bridge&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;services&lt;/span&gt;:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;database&lt;/span&gt;:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;image&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;mysql:8.0&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;container_name&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;database&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;environment&lt;/span&gt;:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;rootpassword&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;MYSQL_DATABASE&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;app_db&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;networks&lt;/span&gt;:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; - &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;app-network&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;backend&lt;/span&gt;:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;build&lt;/span&gt;:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;context&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;./backend&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;dockerfile&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;Dockerfile&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;container_name&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;backend&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;environment&lt;/span&gt;:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;DATABASE_HOST&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;database&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;DATABASE_PORT&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;3306&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;PORT&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;4000&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;depends_on&lt;/span&gt;:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; - &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;database&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;networks&lt;/span&gt;:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; - &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;app-network&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;frontend&lt;/span&gt;:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;build&lt;/span&gt;:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;context&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;./frontend&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;dockerfile&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;Dockerfile&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;container_name&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;frontend&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;environment&lt;/span&gt;:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;PORT&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;3000&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;networks&lt;/span&gt;:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; - &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;app-network&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;nginx&lt;/span&gt;:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;image&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;nginx:alpine&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;container_name&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;nginx&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;ports&lt;/span&gt;:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; - &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;80:80&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;volumes&lt;/span&gt;:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; - &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;./nginx/default.conf:/etc/nginx/conf.d/default.conf:ro&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;depends_on&lt;/span&gt;:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; - &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;frontend&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; - &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;backend&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;networks&lt;/span&gt;:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; - &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;app-network&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="nginx-reverse-proxy-configuration-details"&gt;Nginx Reverse Proxy Configuration Details
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;In Nginx, requests with the &lt;code&gt;/api/&lt;/code&gt; prefix are forwarded to the backend container (&lt;code&gt;backend:4000&lt;/code&gt;), and all other root requests (&lt;code&gt;/&lt;/code&gt;) are forwarded to the frontend container (&lt;code&gt;frontend:3000&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-nginx" data-lang="nginx"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;upstream&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;frontend&lt;/span&gt; {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;server&lt;/span&gt; frontend:&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;3000&lt;/span&gt;;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;}
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;upstream&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;backend&lt;/span&gt; {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;server&lt;/span&gt; backend:&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;4000&lt;/span&gt;;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;}
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;server&lt;/span&gt; {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;listen&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;80&lt;/span&gt;;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;server_name&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;localhost&lt;/span&gt;;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;location&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;/api/&lt;/span&gt; {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;proxy_pass&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;http://backend/api/&lt;/span&gt;;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;proxy_http_version&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;.1&lt;/span&gt;;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;proxy_set_header&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;Upgrade&lt;/span&gt; $http_upgrade;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;proxy_set_header&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;Connection&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;upgrade&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;proxy_set_header&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;Host&lt;/span&gt; $host;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;proxy_cache_bypass&lt;/span&gt; $http_upgrade;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;proxy_set_header&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;X-Real-IP&lt;/span&gt; $remote_addr;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;proxy_set_header&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;X-Forwarded-For&lt;/span&gt; $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;proxy_set_header&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;X-Forwarded-Proto&lt;/span&gt; $scheme;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;location&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt; {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;proxy_pass&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;http://frontend&lt;/span&gt;;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;proxy_http_version&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;.1&lt;/span&gt;;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;proxy_set_header&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;Upgrade&lt;/span&gt; $http_upgrade;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;proxy_set_header&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;Connection&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;upgrade&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;proxy_set_header&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;Host&lt;/span&gt; $host;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;proxy_cache_bypass&lt;/span&gt; $http_upgrade;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;proxy_set_header&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;X-Real-IP&lt;/span&gt; $remote_addr;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;proxy_set_header&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;X-Forwarded-For&lt;/span&gt; $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;proxy_set_header&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;X-Forwarded-Proto&lt;/span&gt; $scheme;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;}
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="distinguishing-internal-states-in-port-binding"&gt;Distinguishing Internal States in Port Binding
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;When architecting container networks, it is critical to accurately distinguish between a container port&amp;rsquo;s exposed state (Exposed) and its published state to host interfaces (Published).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Unpublished Internal State (&lt;code&gt;80/tcp&lt;/code&gt;):&lt;/b&gt; The socket is LISTENing only on the container&amp;rsquo;s internal network stack. Direct connections from outside the Docker network (the host OS or external clients) are rejected.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Published External State (&lt;code&gt;0.0.0.0:80-&amp;amp;gt;80/tcp&lt;/code&gt;):&lt;/b&gt; Port 80 on all network interfaces of the host OS (&lt;code&gt;0.0.0.0&lt;/code&gt;) is forwarded to port 80 inside the container. This enables traffic arriving via public IPs, such as on AWS EC2 or through an ALB, to be correctly forwarded into the infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id="operational-verification-and-status-checks"&gt;Operational Verification and Status Checks
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Following deployment, verify the container run states and the integrity of HTTP responses from the terminal.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;$ docker compose ps
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;NAME IMAGE COMMAND SERVICE CREATED STATUS PORTS
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;backend app-backend &amp;#34;docker-entrypoint.s…&amp;#34; backend 5 minutes ago Up 5 minutes 4000/tcp
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;database mysql:8.0 &amp;#34;docker-entrypoint.s…&amp;#34; database 5 minutes ago Up 5 minutes 3306/tcp, 33060/tcp
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;frontend app-frontend &amp;#34;docker-entrypoint.s…&amp;#34; frontend 5 minutes ago Up 5 minutes 3000/tcp
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;nginx nginx:alpine &amp;#34;/docker-entrypoint.…&amp;#34; nginx 5 minutes ago Up 5 minutes 0.0.0.0:80-&amp;amp;gt;80/tcp, :::80-&amp;amp;gt;80/tcp
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;$ curl -i http://localhost/api/posts
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;HTTP/1.1 200 OK
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Server: nginx/1.25.3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Date: Mon, 17 Nov 2026 10:00:00 GMT
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Content-Length: 124
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Connection: keep-alive
